{"unit_id":"HackenLeung__dsh-meme-deep-dive#readme-1","repo":"HackenLeung/dsh-meme-deep-dive","commit":"5a69203449e45964b8c9d28e0a03cc805963be5c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meme-deep-dive README · dsh-meme-deep-dive：一个为 [DeepSeek Harness Web](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 提供 GIF 表情互动的 DSH 插件\n\n发送消息时，当前选择的 meme 会出现在发送按钮附近；DSH 显示 `Deep diving...` 时，meme 会固定在状态文字左侧。点击 meme 或发送消息时，会显示可自定义的工作文案。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-meme-deep-dive"}
{"unit_id":"HackenLeung__dsh-meme-deep-dive#readme-2","repo":"HackenLeung/dsh-meme-deep-dive","commit":"5a69203449e45964b8c9d28e0a03cc805963be5c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meme-deep-dive README · 功能：- 在设置页切换 meme，并修改工作文案。\n- 设置页使用静态 PNG 预览，实际互动使用 GIF。\n- 设置保存在当前浏览器的 `localStorage` 中。\n- 素材会内嵌到客户端构建产物，运行时不请求本地文件。","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"HackenLeung__dsh-meme-deep-dive#readme-3","repo":"HackenLeung/dsh-meme-deep-dive","commit":"5a69203449e45964b8c9d28e0a03cc805963be5c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meme-deep-dive README · 安装：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:HackenLeung/dsh-meme-deep-dive\n```\n\n打开 DSH Web，进入 `设置 -> 插件 -> 插件配置`，即可找到 `Deep dive meme` 卡片，选择 meme 和修改工作文案。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"HackenLeung__dsh-meme-deep-dive#readme-4","repo":"HackenLeung/dsh-meme-deep-dive","commit":"5a69203449e45964b8c9d28e0a03cc805963be5c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meme-deep-dive README · 本地开发：需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本，以及本地 DSH 环境。\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\nnpm run check\n```\n\n修改 `src/client.js` 或 `assets/memes/` 下的素材后，先运行 `npm run build` 重新生成 `lib/client.js`，再运行 `npm run check`。之后刷新 DSH Web；如果 DSH 缓存了插件 bundle，需要重启 DSH。","source":"extracted","section":"本地开发"}
{"unit_id":"HackenLeung__dsh-meme-deep-dive#readme-5","repo":"HackenLeung/dsh-meme-deep-dive","commit":"5a69203449e45964b8c9d28e0a03cc805963be5c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-meme-deep-dive README · 兼容性：当前客户端通过 `role=\"status\"`、`Deep diving...` 和包含 `_turnStatus` 的 class 来识别深度思考状态。如果 DSH 的 Web 页面结构发生变化，可能需要同步更新 `src/client.js` 中的选择器。","source":"extracted","section":"兼容性"}
